      "setup_steps_en": [
        "Create or choose the recruitment mailbox your company already uses (for example careers@yourcompany.com).",
        "Add a forward (or inbox rule) so every message with a CV attachment is copied to wathefni-cv-d11603@inbound.wathefni.ai.",
